# The ditch at the cost of falling (physics phase 31): sf-scooter-wheelie-ditch's line on another seed. The
# draw twists the rider off at 5 rad/s right, nobody spins against it, and the board comes down 88 degrees
# sideways: a bail, the wheelie and the ditch lost with it. Spinning the other way in the air saves it
# (sf-scooter-ditch-save).
park sf
seed 8
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 358.9 323.7 -1.08 45
tap use 30
hold up 40..398
tap up 400
tap down 406
bot balance
tap ollie 700
run 1000
expect event manualStart{trick=Scooter Wheelie} within 405..409
expect event scooterDitch{spin=-5.015} within 699..703
expect event comboLost{name=Scooter Wheelie + Scooter Ditch} within 811..815
expect event bail within 811..815
expect no event comboLanded
expect van.car.drive.ride.tipped == 1 at 900
